home+='''<main id="main" tabindex="-1"><section class="hero" aria-label="Saanjh wedding atelier">'''+image('ceremony','A wedding ceremony beneath a pink and ivory floral mandap',eager=True)+'''<div class="hero-top eyebrow">For the moments that become everything</div><div class="hero-content"><h1>A weekend.<br><em>A lifetime.</em></h1><div class="hero-copy"><p>Many celebrations. One beautifully considered whole. Weddings imagined around you, from the first thought to the final farewell.</p><a class="textlink" href="#weekend">Step into the weekend</a></div></div><div class="hero-bottom"><span>India & destinations beyond</span><span>Scroll to celebrate</span></div></section><section class="intro wrap"><span class="eyebrow">The art of bringing it all together</span><div class="reveal"><h2>You live every moment.<br>We hold every detail.</h2><p>A wedding is more than the day. It is the welcome, the laughter between events, the right song at the right time. We give the whole weekend a feeling — and a plan.</p></div></section><section class="weekend" id="weekend" aria-label="A wedding weekend in six chapters"><div class="weekend-heading"><span class="eyebrow">From first thought to final farewell</span><span class="eyebrow">One weekend · Six chapters</span></div><div class="weekend-grid"><div class="weekend-picture" aria-hidden="true"><div class="photo-stage">'''
