home+='''<p class="sample-note">Three illustrative planning stories. Names, event counts and guest figures are fictional; photography is for inspiration.</p></section><div class="hover-photo" aria-hidden="true"><img alt="" src="/assets/ceremony.webp"></div><section class="venues" id="destinations"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-title"><div><div class="eyebrow">A sense of place</div><h2>Where it all begins.</h2></div><p>A lakeside palace. A garden in Goa. A gathering by the Gulf.</p></div><div class="atlas"><div class="map-shell"><div class="map-fallback">India<br>& the Arabian Gulf</div><div id="venue-map" role="region" aria-label="Map of suggested destination cities"></div><span class="map-label">A destination shortlist</span></div><div class="venue-list"><button class="venue-select" data-venue="0" aria-pressed="true"><span class="eyebrow">01 · Udaipur, India</span><strong>Taj Lake Palace</strong><small>A lake setting for a celebration with a sense of arrival.</small></button><button class="venue-select" data-venue="1" aria-pressed="false"><span class="eyebrow">02 · Zallaq, Bahrain</span><strong>Sofitel Bahrain</strong><small>A Gulf-side setting for bringing far-flung families together.</small></button><button class="venue-select" data-venue="2" aria-pressed="false"><span class="eyebrow">03 · Majorda, Goa</span><strong>Alila Diwa</strong><small>A garden setting for a slower, more intimate weekend.</small></button><button class="venue-select" data-venue="3" aria-pressed="false"><span class="eyebrow">04 · Jaipur, India</span><strong>Fairmont Jaipur</strong><small>A palace-inspired backdrop for a celebration with scale.</small></button><div class="venue-links"><a id="venue-official" class="textlink" href="https://www.tajhotels.com/en-in/hotels/taj-lake-palace-udaipur" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Explore the venue</a><a id="venue-directions" class="textlink" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Taj+Lake+Palace+Udaipur" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View on Maps</a></div></div></div><p class="sample-note">Suggested venues, not claimed partnerships. Map pins indicate destination cities; availability is confirmed with each venue.</p></div></section><section class="brief-section wrap" id="brief"><div class="brief-layout"><div class="brief-intro"><div class="eyebrow">Your celebration, your way</div><h2>It begins<br>with a thought.</h2><p>Tell us the shape of your weekend. A place, a season, the people you love — we can take it from there.</p><p class="small">Not sure of a detail yet? Choose “Still deciding.” Your brief is a starting point, not a commitment.</p></div><form class="brief-form" id="brief-form">'''
